  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and equation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>, 0</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/EM0026110_AnsExp3_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 171px;\" /><br />on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> lies&nbsp;on a line parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> which is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Hence, on solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Centroid&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>,</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>, 2</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>, 2</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
